{"id":"monster-in-the-garden","title":"The Monster in the Garden","level":2,"series":"Dash Adventures","cover":{"h":"be7750787eda9b6208d89fde0140bfec","t":"image/webp"},"titleAudio":null,"cast":[{"role":"hero","name":"Logan","portrait":{"h":"cf541143e9c73f6a4921ebd5175623cb","t":"image/webp"}},{"role":"sister","name":"Anastasia","portrait":{"h":"4b8a1a7bc845473e95a93b7d3c7d3a7d","t":"image/webp"}},{"role":"dad","name":"Dad","portrait":{"h":"4a3effd5da379d9c095d2ece4f986c49","t":"image/webp"}},{"role":"mum","name":"Mum","portrait":{"h":"4e8d5c2035e2129d567a2a2bbf62e944","t":"image/webp"}},{"role":"dash","name":"Dash","portrait":{"h":"5394e0f1443cd76f83368aaf141c3340","t":"image/webp"}}],"mystery":null,"practise":["camp","tent","torch","crunch","lump","hump","glint","munch"],"common":["they","the","all","little","again","he"],"challenge":["garden","monster","sleeping"],"before":"Have you ever slept in a tent? What might you hear at night?","after":["What did Anastasia think the lump was?","What was it really?","How did Logan find out?","Would you like to camp in the garden? Why?"],"retell":[1,5,6,9,10,14],"pages":[{"text":"Logan, Anastasia and Dash camp in the garden.","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"8fdf14af04c9c7afc423a3e2259fddea","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Evening in the back garden (a cosy British terraced house with a small back garden, a lawn and a wooden shed): a small green tent on the lawn, fairy lights on t","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"They get into the tent. It is dark.","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"a48435f3e20490b7a5d5d6b5b6798385","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Inside the tent by torchlight: Logan and Anastasia snuggled in sleeping bags, Dash in a tiny sleeping bag between them, the torch beam on the tent roof.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"Hoot! An owl sits on the shed.","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"a6ec1061f7612b224fed26904e2eef3a","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"The night garden from outside: moonlight, stars, an owl with big round eyes on the shed roof, and the tent glowing softly on the lawn.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"The stars glint. They all nod off.","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"cd66c373a40676779a949da55875ef26","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Inside the tent: Logan, Anastasia and Dash are drowsy, eyes closing.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"Then... crunch, crunch, crunch!","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"26e55d303d7482aaee1da974180a167e","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Outside on the gravel path, something is coming closer: we only see the gravel and a long moonlit shadow.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"A big dark lump is next to the tent!","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"781e966f32da9350fba71d8139dd7f38","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"From inside the tent: a huge strange silhouette on the tent wall, lumpy, with two tufts on top like horns.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"It has long arms and a big hump!","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"281f150950ef805229a4a67e489c01a0","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"The silhouette on the tent wall stretches out long arms and has a big hump on its back.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"Anastasia yells. Dash jumps into a sleeping bag.","bubble":{"who":"sister","name":"Anastasia","text":"A monster!","side":"left"},"image":{"h":"e86975d1164e4b5c6cc0af764b9aa97d","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Anastasia yells with her hands up while Dash dives head first into Logan's sleeping bag, only his tail sticking out.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"Logan grabs the torch. He points it at the lump.","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"c81d24e40e6acd166d0c5e61d2635010","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Logan, brave, kneels at the tent door and shines the torch out through the open flap.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"It is not a monster. It is Dad!","bubble":{"who":"dad","name":"Dad","text":"Hot drinks and buns!","side":"right"},"image":{"h":"7dd6dc46ac9416622322f86cfb98231c","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"The torch beam shows Dad in a dressing gown and slippers, hair sticking up in two tufts, a rolled-up blanket on his back, carrying a tray with mugs of hot choco","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"Dad gets in the tent too. It is a tight fit!","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"ef0a3971220481d76efed2a2781673e6","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Dad is squeezed into the small tent with Logan, Anastasia and Dash, his knees up by his ears, the tent bulging.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"They munch buns and look at the stars.","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"b6a7b3fe2f5e0d9b283a19b742c50e5e","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"The tent flap is open and everyone looks up at a sky full of stars.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"Then... crunch, crunch! Not again!","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"dee287a7688b51ec39e16735cfcfad0d","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Everyone freezes mid-munch, eyes sliding sideways towards the dark garden.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"A little fox sniffs at the tent. It gets a bun too!","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"3e81488aa343dc7cde232b66881cd342","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"A cute fox cub pokes its nose through the tent flap.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}}],"words":{}}